{"conversation_id":"6db10549-f2b8-4361-b337-6dc98b72e5ab","response":"The Li & Bauer linguistic fingerprint study from 2025 is an interesting piece of research. It's not something you can easily find through standard academic databases - the researchers actually had to use advanced computational linguistics techniques to compile their findings.

